ansferable model is described.","evidence_snippet":"\"evaluate the ability of different model architecture-xAI pairs to first predict an outcome given a sequence as input\""},{"record_id":"rec_000181","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","generative_model_present":"yes","foundation_model_evidence":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"EC4_no_foundation_model_evidence","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The abstract explicitly says the diffusion transformer generates biologically plausible genomic features for missing data. It does not provide evidence of broad pretraining or foundation-model characteristics.","evidence_snippet":"\"a Diffusion Transformer in generating biologically plausible genomic features for missing data\""},{"record_id":"rec_000182","paper_type":"review_editorial","generative_model_present":"yes","foundation_model_evidence":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The abstract centers on generative AI in clinical decision support and discusses LLMs and GANs, so generative methods are clearly present. It is framed as a broad conceptual/architectural article rather than evidence for a foundation model.","evidence_snippet":"\"explores the paradigm shift brought about by Generative Artificial Intelligence (GenAI), specifically Large Language Models (LLMs) and Generative Adversarial Networks (GANs)\""},{"record_id":"rec_000183","paper_type":"review_editorial","generative_model_present":"no","foundation_model_evidence":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"This is a review of IHC quantification methods, not a primary generative model paper. The mention of foundation models is only as part of the reviewed literature.","evidence_snippet":"\"Целью настоящего обзора стало критическое сопоставление\" / \"the analysis revealed ... foundation models and multimodal systems\""},{"record_id":"rec_000184","paper_type":"benchmark_resource",